{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"14700","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:14700","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10478","characterName":"蕾米莉亚·斯卡雷特","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"蕾米莉亚·斯卡雷特","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场时为500岁的萝莉吸血鬼，红魔馆女主人，像贵族般注重威严和体面，性格跟外表一样非常孩子气而任性。害怕流动的水、阳光（会变蒸气，吸到蒸气的人会长生不死）、洋葱，但不怕十字架 (因为不知道有什么好怕)。曾经为了自己方便，将幻想乡笼罩在一片红雾之中（东方红魔乡）。似乎很爱喝咲夜泡的红茶（加B型血的红茶）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478","value":"吸血鬼"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478","value":"操纵命运程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f690d22104f8f111475b1447410272bb87e8f7bccce675c2c305c56607c2853f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11010676fb7eab35e4a04aa8922af5f5f7a65a2e7771da6ad731f94b3003fe69.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10483","characterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"源远流长的西行寺家的大小姐，身为白玉楼的主人的亡灵公主。有脚的。一眼便能看出是什么都不会去想的轻浮的性格，但实际上因为已存在了一段相当长的日子，故此是有一定的知识，有时候会说出些仿佛在追寻着事物的原委般的说话，却往往是没有要点的。已成为了1000年以上的亡灵。不擅长对自己的能力没有效用的蓬莱人。是住在冥界的幽灵们的管理者。‘萃梦想’对战模式的对话中，被萃香指摘她对现世还有执念。“春雪异变”的元凶，让妖梦把“春度”收集起来，把名为“西行妖”的妖怪樱树的封印解封，使埋葬在树下的人复活。与八云紫是老朋友。生前为某“歌圣”的女儿。这个歌圣的名字没有被明确的记录下来，但在 ‘妖妖梦’中登场的和歌为“西行法师”的歌曲，再者幽幽子的姓是“西行寺”。西行寺家的古老文献中有写着“富士见之女孩”，在拥有“操纵死灵的的能力”之后便变成了“诱导别人死亡的能力”，因为厌恶简单地就能诱导人死亡的能力，与每当满开盛放时把许多人都吸引著，并成为了许多人的葬生之地，诱导别人死亡，最后化成了妖树“西行妖”的樱树。于是在“西行妖”满开之时，为了不再让“西行妖”的樱花满开，最后于树下自尽。成为亡灵后忘掉所有生前的记忆，也变得认为诱导别人死亡是一件蛮快乐的事。 (荣获第一届东方最萌冠军)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在历史上西行法师是藤原秀郷的九代孙，是藤原四大家中北家后裔，而北家开祖是藤原不比等的第二子藤原房前。若把西行寺幽幽子与藤原妹红的父亲比拟为历史人物，她们两人就有远亲关系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"亡灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"操纵死亡程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e48a9da0c85b68dc9bff254c340a32988e7d433c926bf7aeb21dae10f5e26368.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3203b696470b87edb27965ae16efb8069e69f6855d79327a84c3e8f6c3ef897.webp","width":126,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10485","characterName":"神出鬼没の妖怪 / 神出鬼沒的妖怪","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"10485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"神出鬼没の妖怪 / 神出鬼沒的妖怪","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隙间妖怪。平常都待在她的隙间里面，是个力量非常强大的妖怪，平常睡十二个小时，外加冬眠，杂事大多交由她的式神-八云蓝（九尾狐）去做。和幽幽子是旧识。紫能够操纵任何事物的界线(例如她把山与湖的界线消去,两个事物都不复存在)。存在了多久，无人知晓(原作中她并不介意别人谈论她的年龄，甚至还会以此自我消遣)，只能得知她在幻想乡出现时就存在了。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10485"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10485","value":"妖怪"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10485","value":"操纵境界的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd979f2021d1fe99ccdad25d7d1965c9b3b12e5414d0ec5fb4c8481e487645c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fbaf945e2b33aa4d13e25c5af042febbff138deed2ee19f9fec6a164f048dfa.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10796","characterName":"七色の人形使い \\ 七色的人偶使","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"150819"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"七色の人形使い \\ 七色的人偶使","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"爱丽丝·玛格特罗依德（Alice Margatroid，アリス·マーガトロイド）东方同人游戏系列中的一个角色，住在魔法森林的魔法使，总是拿着一本魔导书的少女。最早登场于《东方怪绮谈》，后来在《东方妖妖梦》中再次登场，获得了不错的人气。人物设定上旧五作和新作有较大区别，怪绮谈中设定爱丽丝是魔族（魔界人），但新作设定她“原本是人类，经过修行后就成为了称为「魔法使」的种族”。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"魔法使"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"操控人偶程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"操纵魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afbe91c817a0795a52ff7b9e241d9a5d519667ce8f7927672bd25dddff296112.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/813408c8cffd5267b40d160885859319fb88a8487926f1878d75702aca8a3f72.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_11614","characterName":"幽人的庭师","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽人的庭师","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"西行寺行家专属庭师兼幽幽子的护卫。她是代替现时行踪不明，第一代的爷爷魂魄妖忌的第二代庭师。虽也是幽幽子的剑术指导师，但幽幽子仍是把她看作庭师来看待。所谓半人半灵，除了她本身作为“半人”的人类身体的半身，还有就是一只一直紧随她的巨大幽灵，那就是她的“半灵”的半身，也是其“魂魄”家族的共同特征 (“魂魄”家族全为半人半灵,因有半灵的关系，比一般人类长寿。并世世代代侍奉著西行寺家，其后代妖梦就是其中之一)。二刀流剑士，手上有两柄刀，拥有一挥即可杀死十来只幽灵之杀伤力的长刀“楼观剑”，和可以把人的迷惘斩断的“白楼剑”。因为性格认真又率直，常被身边的人（特别是幽幽子）捉弄。感受性很强，在‘永夜抄’的结局中，变成了狂气之眼。不擅长面对怪物等恐怖的事。 ‘文花帖（书籍）’中，也会使用了替幽幽子代管的“人魂灯”(‘香霖堂’第12话“模糊的光、窗户的雪”中登场，用作收集幽灵用的道具)，把幽灵收集。根据不同的作品，其性格也有若干的不同，性格并没有被固定起来。‘儚月抄’中那完全天然的性格与‘妖妖梦’中那种逞强的性格截然不同。‘妖妖梦’时瞳孔为红色，‘萃梦想’以后变成了青色。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614","value":"半人半灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614","value":"使用剑术程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff2fba2e98d606edd5cabe06b21c90c3b6addfda44d96433583cf53ad55fa04b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/252c2df78fb394b8950a5fd2cac232ed665afc965fabe91aa9895c542cb3660d.webp","width":231,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_12688","characterName":"十六夜 咲夜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"十六夜 咲夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是住在红魔馆并在里面工作的女仆。是被称之为恶魔之馆的红魔馆中唯一的人类，是女仆们的仆长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是个在普通人类不敢接近的地方工作的不可思议的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"没人见过她在进入红魔馆之前是怎样的。而且她对幻想乡里人类的来访极为冷淡，常站在妖怪的阵营之中。所以人们觉得她不是幻想乡的人类，有可能是外面世界或者是别的世界来的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她没有和村落里任何人类亲近，身上含有许多谜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过，当她去村落买东西时，她会一脸愉快，一点也没有敌视人类的样子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688","value":"操纵时间的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/badfc65679c51a64f83971b2fbcf3fd13d46dab33013f71db781edf64f76f640.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a45982af2e686a3ac26458362bc4b1715751ec4821b9bd2da5964412df51d2bd.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20130","characterName":"やさか かなこ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20130","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"20130","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"20130","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"やさか かなこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"守矢神社所供奉的神明"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为在外界得不到信仰的关系，所以和早苗一起决定将守矢神社迁进幻想乡，希望能在幻想乡内收集到信仰"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"刚进入幻想乡时一直被天狗们警戒着，后来经过交涉之后和解"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格豪爽，大方，不拘小节。非常开朗，头脑也很明晰"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为从外界来的关系，似乎对外界的技术和科学知识有着高度的了解"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"爱好技术革命，不过似乎是因为为了获得信仰？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢宴会，和人类与妖怪游玩是她希望的信仰方式"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主导著守矢神社的信仰心"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原本是风神，不过在经过许多波折之后变成了山神"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"符卡名均来源于诹访神社的传说与惯例"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20130"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20130","value":"神灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20130","value":"创造乾程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a44ce4116037db504edf0f96e12a72ee75eb8179940c6c406ab2be957783b72d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f7b49b41c9035985fdc531476abd6b33b0ef40d62813c31bb73069f8a1e03cb.webp","width":182,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20131","characterName":"土著神的顶点","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20131","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"20131","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"20131","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"土著神的顶点","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"守矢神社真正供奉的神明"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在远古时候拥有非常恐怖的信仰心，作为神的同时甚至作为王建立了一个王国"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为在和神奈子的战斗中败北而投降，将王国交出"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过因为神奈子无法得到王国人们的信仰，而变成了在神奈子背后一起治理着王国的情况"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"随着时间的流逝，诹访子渐渐的被人们所遗忘，记得诹访子真名的人，也几乎没有了"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"此时神奈子决定将守矢神社迁到幻想乡内，从此诹访子在幻想乡内开始了新的生活"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"诹访子是早苗遥远的祖先，不过早苗对此却完全不知情"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20131"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20131","value":"神明（土著神）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20131","value":"创造坤（地）程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a5241709cc4571e16292d3daf08de9ffd9fb5f6db2b70ca6b885ec975bde2bd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1c313ab7a2dae13aac5be7b8ebef0080b78598e66c51adc21543ad533c2e46b.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29616","characterName":"ながえ いく","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29616","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"29616","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ながえ いく","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29616","value":"妖怪（龙宫使者）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29616","value":"解读周遭程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75dd59d7e0bd1fcd90aa690ec9f6dc3060a2ccbc451f76589a481e273879e288.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6dda6f34c78cb2a7eb975d4722d6f1c0c6b5347fe6d6460964e3220da1c1e987.webp","width":256,"height":248,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29663","characterName":"熱かい悩む神の火 \\ 难以驾驭的神之火","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29663","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"29663","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"29663","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"熱かい悩む神の火 \\ 难以驾驭的神之火","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有着特别姿态的鸦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"左足是\"分解之足\"、右足是\"融合之足\"、还有制御两者的右手\"第三足\"，她以这三足操控着究极的能源。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"空的任务是看守灼热地狱遗迹让它不至失控。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体内拥有称为八咫乌的神明。八咫乌拥有的究极之力量，就是创造原子的力量－核融合。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29663"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29663","value":"地狱鸦"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29663","value":"操控核融合的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a8f00e72e6f71036bfa2e12f115bc7d5926836508d108490855c7a61d1380f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70c7d8199a57908f09f3d5f093898b1640380f3f3060c3458c304db9d4e98172.webp","width":212,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_485","characterName":"博麗靈夢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"博麗靈夢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幻想乡境内博丽神社的现有巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"博丽神社是专门守护幻想乡不可缺少的大结界的神社。博丽的巫女代代以解决异变为事业。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是历代巫女中最缺乏危机感的一位，不知是因为修行不足，还是因为已经拥有足够的实力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她天生地幸运和敏锐，也退治了不少妖怪。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"主要是在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"作为博丽巫女的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"操纵灵气的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f33007c417ade7c73b7ee78244285c2ff601da86919605a6f56c0570deb01c0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc26d83763ce8144e0a342eaeb5a41bf3e1756ec782d0268170ef9bac39c8489.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_486","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"霧雨魔理沙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住于魔法森林的人类魔法使，常骑着扫把，「霧雨店」的独生女。會使用魔法森林的蘑菇調製火藥，所使用的魔法幾乎只有把東西破壞的效果，而且燃料需要長時間準備，但是其效果非常強力，在Spell Card規則成立下，純粹的破壞力在人類當中屬於最高等級。此外在幻想乡是出了名的小偷，帕邱莉的图书馆、香霖堂，如果不是古明地觉会读心术，甚至连地灵殿都会惨遭毒手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e00e4df671f5f80d5733c44e4b69596b901aad88177fc335789c2dd5ea6b2d6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3bd6c6ab5c1df20f216ccf8f7e1581841d4fed04fe2cad0f92ce726df7fb8d1.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_487","characterName":"射命丸 文","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"射命丸 文","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"射命丸文是天狗之中速度很快的鸦天狗。手持相机，在幻想乡各处奔走，记录下各种有趣的事件。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说是鸦天狗，外表和人类并无太大差别。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"随身带着的道具是团扇、相机和文花帖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"团扇是起风的道具，一扇能刮倒屋子，二扇能刮倒大树，三扇能将旅人的斗篷吹飞。是天狗的武器。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相机是天狗的另一件武器。能将瞬间景象拍下的必杀武器（×1拍摄速度也十分地惊人。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拍下的相片会登载在新闻报纸上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文花帖是将能成为新闻记事的题材记录起来的天狗的笔记本。里面混杂了各种相片和手写文字（×2天狗的手写体意外地可爱。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"操纵风的能力，指的是既能瞬间吹起狂风又能瞬间让狂风停止，还能肆意刮起龙卷风，纯粹追求强力的猛烈技能。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487","value":"鸦天狗（花映冢、风神录、绯想天）/天狗（地灵殿、求闻史纪、天空璋）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487","value":"操纵风程度的能力（花映冢、风神录、绯想天、地灵殿、求闻史纪、天空璋）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76964ca8ed3f6929b65c57aee506edb84d82d9d95c36aa5803ddc89f98434a70.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c30a2767989de1befcc33502cf3697399f51b28cb405e96be8425b397255b10.webp","width":161,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_488","characterName":"知识与避世的少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"知识与避世的少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大概有100岁的魔女，平常待在红魔馆里面的图书馆的知识分子，有气喘的毛病。擅长操纵七曜（火水木金土日月），名言是“凡物都有属性。所谓的属性，跟弱点是一样的东西”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Patchouli→广藿香（一种香草，因此她有“帕琪”“香草”一类的昵称），Knowledge→知识"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"魔女、魔法使"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"使用魔法（主要是属性）程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"使用魔法（主要是精灵魔法）的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"操纵火+水+木+金+土+日+月的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8493e88bcc7680de30e8b9e6e66890ad487612a220d97d4b7f4da9fa8fe97d9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de86334f8179285b5b96f03c533ec39d91050913e666646d4b78d3ba0862f3c0.webp","width":151,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_491","characterName":"萃集的梦想、虚幻、以及百鬼夜行","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"491","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"491","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"491","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"491","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"}]},"originalCharacterName":"萃集的梦想、虚幻、以及百鬼夜行","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊吹萃香是不知为何会出现在幻想乡的鬼，由于幻想乡有相当长的时间没出现过鬼，对于驱鬼的方法已经失传许久，没人会退治鬼，大家都感到为难。因此萃香和其他的鬼才能定居下来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然外表是一个小女孩，看上去并不吓人，但她是一只已活了几百年的鬼，拥有将事物集结与分散程度的能力，和着让人害怕的怪力。她曾夸下海口，只要她想，就能凭一人之力将妖怪之山推倒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"萃香十分喜欢喝酒，常带着一个酒葫芦并喝得醉醺醺的，在东方的三款格斗游戏中，都可以看到她走路是摇摇晃晃的。其原形来自于鬼头目之中的“酒吞童子”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格豪爽，喜欢酒与宴会，天真而且单纯，喜欢和人一较高下，像是小孩子的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其名字“萃香”与“西瓜”的日文发音相同，故昵称为“西瓜”。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"491"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"491","value":"鬼"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"491","value":"操纵疏和密程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3b26c2b4a7516dd3021fca524fbac36766a3a15ac6c0f0608e8985f863fd908e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5cf3c4a5114c940dc5fe2dbcd5a1e16e20ce962712501a7e576be5ba0e14de42.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_889","characterName":"東風谷 早苗","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"東風谷 早苗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"住在妖怪之山上的守矢神社的巫女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"889"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"889","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"889","value":"引发奇迹程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b1c4cec24100603ccda5fb96eda4303e1cc0ee88841ee32d35f05a2905a1efd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46d80e50773b6c9b14e3ada0d949ea2c94dd248ab95c87a252bcd67ab59d5f22.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_890","characterName":"湖上的冰精","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"湖上的冰精","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"在雾之湖的附近，即使是夏天也会出现极端低温。这时候常能遇到的妖精就是冰之妖精。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是湖附近妖精们中的领袖般的存在，力量也比其他妖精强。她是属于好战型的，所以必须留神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她身高颇低，穿蓝色的衣服，背后有冰之羽翼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她有操控冷气的能力。能瞬间冻结小东西，比普通的妖精更危险。一直在释放冷气的她周围总是很寒冷。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人们不知道她住在哪里，也无法得知她平时的生活是怎样的。不光是琪露诺，所有的妖精都能溶入大自然之中，所以人类们看不见。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"890"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"890","value":"妖精"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"890","value":"操控冷气程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25af4f6889a331e39b0794d719a1f9518b4db2435d771266f0facafae6918544.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbae3be8cbaf201d20a01a4252681feb495db0eacefea46e8410e4782bb64341.webp","width":180,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_891","characterName":"中国","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"891","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"891","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"891","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"891","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"中国","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"红魔馆的门卫，外表和人类一样，身穿中国风的服装，身手敏捷，擅长武术，很少使用奇怪的妖术。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"891"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"891","value":"妖怪"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"891","value":"运用气程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89eb0b92b5535ad1b1d26f43e6a8b3f7aa420498af3bc36262c7bacddbe9d2d1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c77ddb506dcd6dddad5701b208b0e10e4902210cb7a30d86a578a52d2228f52.webp","width":126,"height":254,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:1774","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1774","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:1774","name":"黄昏フロンティア","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-brand:14700:1774","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable","egs-creator-credit-missing","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
